---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: sequences
---
KV cache estimate for tiny.gguf (llama)

  block_count    2
  head_count     4
  head_count_kv  2      grouped-query attention, 2 heads per KV head
  key_length     64     embedding_length 256 / head_count 4
  value_length   64     embedding_length 256 / head_count 4
  cache type     q8_0   34 bytes per 32 elements
  context        4,096  tokens per sequence
  sequences      4

formula
  K per layer and token = row_size(q8_0, 2 x 64 = 128) = 136 B
  V per layer and token = row_size(q8_0, 2 x 64 = 128) = 136 B
  total = sequences x ctx x block_count x (K + V)
        = 4 x 4,096 x 2 x 272 B
        = 8,912,896 B (8.50 MiB)
